<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Metrogas started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Metrogas started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Lyonnais said analyst Martin Casa had started coverage of Argentine natural gas utility Metrogas SA with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a March 12 report, Casa wrote, &quot;We anticipate a 36 percent increase in Metrogas' net profits in 1997, resulting from absence of extraordinary losses and a 19 percent improvement in operating profits.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
